        "speaker": "jules",
        "text": "The remote team hears decisions after they are made.",
        "translation": "远程团队总是在决定做出后才听到消息。"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "amira",
        "text": "We need an inclusive process that shares the draft before the meeting.",
        "translation": "我们需要一个包容的流程，在会议前分享草案。"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "jules",
        "text": "That would make feedback part of the decision, not an afterthought.",
        "translation": "这样反馈就会成为决定的一部分，而不是事后补救。"
      }
    ],
